  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7268301",
      "subQuestName": "Go look at the person drawing",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "726830101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "726830101": {
            "id": "726830101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "*cough* No... This is still no good... It won't do...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830102"
            ]
          },
          "726830102": {
            "id": "726830102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Any further delay and I'll miss the next submission deadline... *sob*...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830105"
            ]
          },
          "726830105": {
            "id": "726830105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Huh!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830106"
            ]
          },
          "726830106": {
            "id": "726830106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "I'm sorry—soooo sorry! I will submit it today!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830107"
            ]
          },
          "726830107": {
            "id": "726830107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! Hang on, we...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830108"
            ]
          },
          "726830108": {
            "id": "726830108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Miss Moriko, please just give me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830109"
            ]
          },
          "726830109": {
            "id": "726830109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Huh? So you aren't Miss Moriko... Thank goodness... Ugh *coughing*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830110"
            ]
          },
          "726830110": {
            "id": "726830110",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So who is Miss Moriko...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830111"
            ]
          },
          "726830111": {
            "id": "726830111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Miss Moriko is my executive editor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830112"
            ]
          },
          "726830112": {
            "id": "726830112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "My name is Asagiri. I'm a, um, a freelance illustrator of sorts. Miss Moriko is... the executive editor in charge of my work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830113"
            ]
          },
          "726830113": {
            "id": "726830113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "An illustrator? What does that mean?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830114"
            ]
          },
          "726830114": {
            "id": "726830114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "I suppose you've read some light novels of Yae Publishing House, haven't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830115"
            ]
          },
          "726830115": {
            "id": "726830115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Have you noticed that a light novel usually contains a few pages of pure pictures?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830116"
            ]
          },
          "726830116": {
            "id": "726830116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Such pictures are what we call illustrations, and those who draw them are illustrators.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830117"
            ]
          },
          "726830117": {
            "id": "726830117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "To serve an important scene or plot, or to give the protagonist a face, some authors will have people draw them an illustration.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830118"
            ]
          },
          "726830118": {
            "id": "726830118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "The illustration not only creates a more immersive reading experience but also enriches the novel.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830119"
            ]
          },
          "726830119": {
            "id": "726830119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Paimon gets it now. It's no simple business to make light novels...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830120"
            ]
          },
          "726830120": {
            "id": "726830120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "I can recommend a few novels to you! For example... ahem! *coughing*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830121"
            ]
          },
          "726830121": {
            "id": "726830121",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830122"
            ]
          },
          "726830122": {
            "id": "726830122",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "I'm fine. I've never been very healthy — with all the midnight-oil burning and meal skipping during my work...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830123"
            ]
          },
          "726830123": {
            "id": "726830123",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "*cough* As a result, my health keeps deteriorating...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830124"
            ]
          },
          "726830124": {
            "id": "726830124",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Since you're unwell, why are you still working here out in the open? Can't you draw at home?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830125"
            ]
          },
          "726830125": {
            "id": "726830125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "I'm here to gather some inspiration.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830126"
            ]
          },
          "726830126": {
            "id": "726830126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "My muse has left me recently. I've missed the deadlines for a few illustrations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830127"
            ]
          },
          "726830127": {
            "id": "726830127",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "Miss Moriko has postponed the deadlines for me several times. She'll be so mad if I dare delay any further.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830128"
            ]
          },
          "726830128": {
            "id": "726830128",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "I was thinking that maybe a walk in the open would bring my muse back, so I decided to go on a trip.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830129"
            ]
          },
          "726830129": {
            "id": "726830129",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "But as it turned out... Haha... You see, it hadn't taken long before I ended up in this miserable state...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830130"
            ]
          },
          "726830130": {
            "id": "726830130",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Asagiri",
            "text": "*sigh* I'd better put up a request at the Adventurers' Guild and see if any adventurer with a Kamera can help out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "726830131"
            ]
          },
          "726830131": {
            "id": "726830131",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Speaking of the Kamera..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
